<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><fdroid><repo icon="icon.png" name="OrangeDeck" pubkey="" timestamp="1790359399" url="https://fdroid.orangedeck.dev/repo" version="20002"><description>The official repository of OrangeDeck, a live view of the Bitcoin mempool. APKs are the ones from the GitHub releases, signed by the developer.</description></repo><application id="dev.orangedeck.OrangeDeck"><id>dev.orangedeck.OrangeDeck</id><added>2026-09-19</added><lastupdated>2026-09-25</lastupdated><name>OrangeDeck</name><summary>Live view of the Bitcoin mempool</summary><desc>The Bitcoin mempool as a living tile mosaic: waiting transactions fall onto a heap, confirmed ones fly into the block. Alongside it a block clock, mining figures, a block explorer to leaf through and a watch-only view of your own addresses.

The application is a viewer and nothing else. It holds no private key, cannot sign, and ships no library that could. There is no server of its own, no counting, no crash reports and no account.

Home screen widgets show block height, mempool, price, mining network and your own miner.
